dftd4
------------------------------------------
This is a minimal standalone version of DFT-D4 providing the D4(EEQ)-ATM and
D4(EEQ)-MBD methods.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdftd4-devel-4.3.0-1bl1
  libdftd4_4-4.3.0-1bl1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  liblapack0-3.12.0-1
  libmctc-lib-devel-0.7.0-1bl1
  libmctc-lib0-0.7.0-1bl1
  libmulticharge-devel-0.5.0-1bl2
  libmulticharge0-0.5.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  liblapack-devel-3.12.0-1
  libmctc-lib-devel-0.7.0-1bl1
  libmstore-devel-0.4.0-1bl1
  libmulticharge-devel-0.5.0-1bl2
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dftd4/dftd4

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dftd4/dftd4/archive/refs/tags/v4.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dftd4-4.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dftd4-4.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dftd4-4.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dftd4-4.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdftd4_4-4.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdftd4-devel-4.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

